Package: DataDetective
Title: Automated Dataset Investigation Platform
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Vijay", "Mahes", email = "Vijaypradhap2004@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An automated statistical data-quality, exploratory analysis, and anomaly investigation platform built with R and Shiny. Provides systematic data profiling, transparent heuristic quality scoring, IQR outlier diagnostics, correlation and multicollinearity detection, and report generation.
